prime-agent requires Node 22.8.0 or newer, but the active Node is v20.19.6.

  1. Install Node 22.8.0+ (e.g. "nvm install 22 && nvm use 22", or from https://nodejs.org)
  2. Reinstall prime-agent under that Node so the command resolves to it:
     https://github.com/PrimeIntellect-ai/prime-agent/releases/latest
